id: pm-web-fhob
title: Consolidate unresolved spawn-overlap scheduling work into pm-web-qdhx
description: "The unchanged spawn-fallback regression in test/pm-runner.test.ts failed during PR #176 standalone validation with SDK 2026.10.10. It observed start first, end first, start independent, end independent, start second, end second. Same-workspace serialization held, but the independent child did not start within the first child 120 ms delay under heavy shared verification load. Use an explicit ready/release protocol to prove independent dispatch without depending on process startup order; preserve real subprocess assertions and timeout behavior. This is a test-reliability follow-up, not an established SDK dispatch defect. Do not relax coverage, duplication or graph timing gates."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
