completed_at: "2026-10-21T19:37:47.424Z"
author: codex-attestation
resolution: "Consolidated into the existing unresolved owner pm-web-qdhx. Main 874ef8f still uses a 120 ms delay in the first spawn-fallback overlap fixture; PR 197 repaired the different mixed SDK/spawn fixture, not this scheduling assumption. Evidence: test/pm-runner.test.ts, especially the first spawn-fallback test and the later independent-write release handshake. This resolution records ownership consolidation, not a delivered fix."
