comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-11T05:46:04.382Z",codex-attestation,The completed first standalone npm run preserves the startup-order failure receipt; the attempted local Bun gate was intentionally interrupted by the orchestrator to avoid further shared-host contention. No runner production code or assertion is changed in PR #176. Independent CI on the pushed head remains the next evidence source; keep this follow-up open.
  "2026-10-22T11:45:21.994Z",codex-agent,"Corrective audit after checking main 874ef8f and the complete pm-web-qdhx record: qdhx already owns and links the exact first spawn-fallback overlap test. Its existing in_progress status retains an owner for the still-present 120 ms assumption. Replaced this records incorrect delivered-fix claim and unrelated catalog evidence with an explicit consolidation into qdhx; no new closure operation or implementation change was made."
